{
  "id": "voyager-light-day",
  "title": "Voyager 1: one light-day from Earth",
  "voice": "af_heart",
  "speed": 1.0,
  "lead_in": 0.15,
  "tail": 0.9,
  "lines": [
    {"id": "L1",  "gap": 0.16, "text": "Light reaches / the Moon / in about / a second."},
    {"id": "L2",  "gap": 0.30, "text": "The Sun? / {Eight|8} minutes."},
    {"id": "L3",  "gap": 0.34, "text": "But on / November {eighteenth,|18,} / a machine / from the {nineteen-seventies|1970s} / will be / so far away, / that light / needs a / full day / to reach it."},
    {"id": "L4",  "gap": 0.20, "text": "This is / Voyager {One.|1.}"},
    {"id": "L5",  "gap": 0.32, "text": "Launched in / {nineteen seventy-seven,|1977,} / it flies at / {seventeen|17} kilometers / every second."},
    {"id": "L6",  "gap": 0.34, "text": "And it still took / {forty-nine|49} years / to cover / what light does / in a day."},
    {"id": "L7",  "gap": 0.30, "text": "Now every command / takes a day / to arrive, / and another day / to answer."},
    {"id": "L8",  "gap": 0.30, "text": "Its computers / have less memory / than one photo / on your phone."},
    {"id": "L9",  "gap": 0.36, "text": "And a light-year? / At this speed, / that's over / {seventeen thousand|17,000} years / away."},
    {"id": "L10", "gap": 0.0,  "text": "Follow for / part {two:|2:} / the message / it carries, / for whoever / finds it."}
  ],
